OL,3,GNEWSALocations sought to train and
OL,4,Adevelop police dogs
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are seeking safe and suitable
OL,7,Fenvironments where they can train and
OL,8,Fdevelop police dogs.
OL,10,FDevon and Cornwall Police said its dogs
OL,11,Fneeded to practice sniffing, searching
OL,12,Fand chasing skills on a regular basis
OL,13,Fbut the force was "really struggling"
OL,14,Fto find appropriate venues.
OL,16,FTo support its search, it is appealing
OL,17,Fto land and property owners and local
OL,18,Fbusinesses for help finding adequate
OL,19,Fspaces.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
