OL,3,GNEWSALocations sought to train and
OL,4,Adevelop police dogs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said it was on the lookout
OL,7,Ffor large areas of lands such as fields
OL,8,Fand farmland, as well as both vacant
OL,9,Fand used buildings, on the Exeter, M5,
OL,10,FA30, and A38 corridors.
